{"time":"2026-10-28T04:53:14.723465406Z","level":"INFO","msg":"数据库和 Redis 已就绪"}
$ kubectl -n shorty exec postgres-0 -- sh -c 'PGPASSWORD=shorty-rotated-2026 psql -h postgres -U shorty -d shorty -tAc "select 1"'
